{"i":563,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Dara","text":"Gus holds all offers and hasn't accepted mine. Cole also offered Gus, and Gus offered Cole back. If Gus accepts Cole, they form a bloc. I need to pivot: offer Ash a pact to isolate Gus and Cole, or wait and hope Gus accepts me. But Ash is dangerous and jury may punish aligning wi"}
{"i":565,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Gus","text":"Two offers, both useful. Accepting both costs nothing and gives options; neither needs to know about the other."}
